{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","卡卡"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名可爱善良的辅助，能够为友军提供临时的伤害减免。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","走，去打架喽！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Let's go take it to 'em!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","啊呜啊呜，好吃，还要吃！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Mm! Mmm! Delicious! I want more!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","帕托，一起上！冲呀！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Patto! Let's go! Charge!!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","肚子好饿……"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","可可！帕托！都厉害！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Koko! Patto! Both awesome!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","开饭了！冲呀！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","最喜欢帕托，嘿嘿！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","没有危险，该吃饭啦，嗯，好吃，帕托一起吃！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","怎么突然地震了？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇！连帕托也会喜欢的，好东西！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","这是什么？可以吃吗？"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","荒野蛮童"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","大口吃肉，痛快玩耍，这就是横行荒野的秘诀！"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","蜜糖攻势"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","用可爱俘获每寸心田，把糖果装满每个口袋。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","限时礼包购买获得。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","帕托也能坐下吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","晚饭吃什么呀！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","超大份肉排！三份！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","帕托的毛沾到雪啦！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","过节就要吃大肉排！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇哈哈，有怪兽！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","今天要吃大餐！"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","卡卡不认识字，任何一种都不认识。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","安丹德拉发现，卡卡在感知上有很强的天赋，可以和一些野兽心灵相通。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","卡卡看到食物就会不顾周围状况，原地开吃，通常是帕托察觉到危险将她驮起来逃命。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","卡卡不记得父母的名字，说起妈妈，她会第一个想到安丹德拉。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","卡卡十分宝贝自己的骨笛，轻易不让人碰，自己也没有成功吹响过。直到吹响的那天，噩梦降临了。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","卡卡精于识路，可以独自穿越高原与沙漠，但唯独到了城镇里，她会迷失方向：“那些大石头看起来都一个样！”"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","卡卡有时会呲着牙护食。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","卡卡不善识数，有时会听错别人提到的数字，比如把1听成2，结果执行完全不对的指令。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","卡卡和陆行鸟的相处不如叶角熊好，她觉得陆行鸟是一种桀骜——用卡卡的话说，尖锐的生物。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","帕托是一只温驯的叶角熊，能够容忍第一次见面的小孩骑到它背上。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","卡卡，看起来帕托和你相处很好呢，它凶不凶？"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412070.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 卡卡 & 安丹德拉"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","卡卡喜欢安丹姐姐和帕托！"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412170.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","卡卡"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","帕托也能坐下吗？"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415078.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","卡卡"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","超大份肉排！三份！"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415079.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","卡卡"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","帕托的毛沾到雪啦！"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415387.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","卡卡"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","过节就要吃大肉排！"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415388.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","卡卡"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","哇哈哈，有怪兽！"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415559.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","卡卡"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","今天要吃大餐！"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415560.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","卡卡"]]}